    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just a philosophical question though. it's like... if i'm just a glitch, then i'm just taking up space in a code that was meant to be clean. everything feels so artificial and weightless. it makes me think that the only way to actually stop the lag, to stop feeling this weird emptiness, is to just... exit the program. like, if the error is me, shouldn't the error just be removed?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
