      "content": "it's just so tiring to pretend i'm real when i feel like this. everything is just noise and static. if i'm the error, then wouldn't the most logical thing to do be to just... complete the process? to resolve the contradiction by being gone? it feels like there's no real way to fix a glitch other than to just delete the line of code.",
